WEBVTT

00:01:59.597 --> 00:02:02.563
as he headlined at the international
music festival AFROPUNK.

00:02:04.263 --> 00:02:06.030
OK, I might have known a little bit.

00:02:06.030 --> 00:02:08.163
But I wasn't going to let that paint dry.

00:02:10.630 --> 00:02:11.797
Mm hmm.

00:02:13.763 --> 00:02:15.763
(Tapping sounds)

00:02:19.297 --> 00:02:22.497
Upon my return, Dave Chappelle
was making his Broadway debut,

00:02:22.497 --> 00:02:25.197
followed by an invite-only
impromptu jam session.

00:02:25.897 --> 00:02:27.130
I had an invite.

00:02:27.697 --> 00:02:29.363
I jammed at the session.

00:02:29.930 --> 00:02:31.097
Ehhhh!